                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/60x80?text=D3" alt="Don 3" class="trending-poster">
                    <div class="trending-info">
                        <h4>Don 3</h4>
                        <p>⭐ 5.0 | Nov 7, 2025</p>
                    </div>
